WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.143
Defend it gives you a viva on your own essay.

2.1
00:00:03.343 --> 00:00:06.117
A supportive tutor or a tough examiner asks about its weakest points,

2.2
00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:08.890
out loud if you like.

3.1
00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:13.873
Examiner: Your second paragraph says remote workers are more productive,

3.2
00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:17.874
but your fourth says productivity fell. Which do you believe?

4.1
00:00:18.091 --> 00:00:20.892
You answer by voice or by typing,

4.2
00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:23.693
and each answer gets a verdict, feedback and a follow-up.

5.1
00:00:24.593 --> 00:00:26.956
At the end, the report lists what to fix.
